  m_Text: '<b>XR SIMULATOR CONTROLS</b>

    - <b>Toggle Overlay:</b> Tab / F1

    -
    <b>Manipulate HMD:</b> Hold <b>L-Shift</b>

    - <b>Manipulate L-Ctrl:</b> Hold
    <b>Space</b>

    - <b>Manipulate R-Ctrl:</b> Hold <b>L-Alt</b>

    - <b>Move
    Mode (selected):</b> W/A/S/D (QE up/down)

    - <b>Rotate Mode (selected):</b>
    Hold <b>RMB</b> + Mouse

    - <b>Grip / Trigger:</b> G / LMB

    - <b>Unlock
    Mouse:</b> Esc

'
